[1.132317, "o", "  evidence_bundle.json                20K\r\n  evidence_report.md                 2.9K\r\n  extracted_models.json              5.6K\r\n  final_model_spec.yaml              7.8K\r\n  gap_report.json                    4.3K\r\n  methods_draft.md                   2.9K\r\n"]
[1.132765, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.132832, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m"]
[1.136403, "o", "══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n"]
[1.136765, "o", "  THE WOW MOMENT\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\r\n"]
[1.136803, "o", "  In one command, we turned open-ended survey text into a structured causal\r\n  model — 15 variables, 10 relationships, 10 scored hypotheses — where EVERY\r\n"]
[1.136813, "o", "  claim points at the verbatim quote that supports it, plus a documented list\r\n  of gaps and a deterministic evaluation with bootstrap confidence intervals.\r\n"]
[1.136818, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.136925, "o", "  All of it:  fully offline, no API key, byte-for-byte reproducible. That is\r\n  the reproducibility research tools are missing.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[33m→ To run the LIVE pipeline (with real LLM extraction) instead:\u001b[0m\r\n  export OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...\r\n  uv run python3 main.py -i data/raw/synthetic_workplace_survey.csv\r\n\r\n"]
